File name: BHB2LOOP.MP
Path description: Dark Caverns, including caveworms, hellhounds and spiders.
Path starts: Black House, Basement.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Original Game
Level recommendation: 13-17
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: caveworm, grey spider, giant bat, hellhound, dark
